-- tolosa.talk, rewritten against the damocles Library (ADR 0020). Compare
-- prototype/example-hosts: prototypes/example-hosts/03-browser-damocles/scripts/tolosa.talk.
-- Owned by the Body TOLOSA (body-25). `session` is a well-known object name,
-- bound at load (ADR 0016).

use epilogue from damocles

script variable visited = false     -- flag word bit 1 in the original

on landed body
  if not visited then
    put true into visited
    ask display to say "script56-inline-1" and wait
    ask display to say "script56-inline-2" and wait
  end if
  ask display to say "tolosa-attack" and wait
  set the encounterGate of session to 1
  epilogue and wait
  -- Was a bare `epilogue`, which found no Handler here and climbed the
  -- Message Path as a `send` that didn't wait, so the blank line raced the
  -- next landing. Now it's a plain call in THIS Run. The Run holds until the
  -- blank line has shown, and `and wait` shows the reader it pauses.
  -- The loader checks both ways: a bare `epilogue` is now a load error,
  -- because epilogue may suspend.
end landed
